title: The budget
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_government
view-if: psoe_in_government = 1 and budget_timer <= 0
on-display: {!
if (typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.SpainGame) {
    window.SpainGame.renderVote(Q, 'sp-budget-count', 'budget');
}
!}

= The budget

Without a budget of your own, the government lives on its predecessor's spending plans. María Jesús Montero has a draft ready. This is the likely vote:

{!<div id="sp-budget-count"></div>!}

- @present: Present the budget to Congress
- @root: Not yet

@present
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1; Q.budget_timer = 12;
if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.holdBudget(Q); }
if (Q.budget_passed) {
    Q.sanchez_authority += 8; Q.budget_year = Q.year; Q.fiscal_adj += 0.2;
    if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {pensioners: 1, workers: 1, unemployed: 1}); }
} else {
    Q.sanchez_authority -= 6;
}
!}
go-to: budget_passed if budget_passed = 1; budget_failed if budget_passed = 0

@budget_passed
title: Budget approved

= Budget approved

Yes [+ inv_yes +], no [+ inv_no +]. The government has its own budget: higher pensions, more for dependency care, more for science.

@budget_failed
title: Budget defeated

= Budget defeated

Yes [+ inv_yes +], no [+ inv_no +]. Congress throws out your budget. Governing on rolled-over accounts is possible, but every week of it is a week your opponents call you a Prime Minister without a majority.

- @snap: Call an early general election
- @carry_on: Carry on with the rolled-over budget

@snap
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.callElection(Q); } Q.member_morale += 3; !}

You announce the dissolution of the Cortes. Spain votes in two months.

@carry_on
on-arrival: sanchez_authority -= 3

You govern by decree where you can and by patience where you cannot.

@minimum_wage
title: The minimum wage
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_government
view-if: psoe_in_government = 1 and wage_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; wage_timer = 12

= The minimum wage

The minimum wage is €736 a month. The unions want €1,000; business warns of job losses.

- @big_rise: Raise it by 22% in one go
- @gradual: Raise it gradually over the legislature
- @easy_discard

@big_rise
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {workers: 3, unemployed: 1.5, students: 1, self_employed: -1.5}); } Q.trade_unionists_dissent -= 8; Q.rel_up += 6; Q.rel_cs -= 6; Q.wage_rise = 2; !}

The largest rise since 1977. The Bank of Spain warns about employment; the workers who get it do not.

@gradual
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {workers: 1.5, unemployed: 0.5}); } Q.trade_unionists_dissent -= 3; Q.rel_cs += 2; Q.wage_rise = 1; !}

Prudent and predictable. The unions call it a missed opportunity.

@memory
title: Historical memory
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_government
view-if: psoe_in_government = 1 and memory_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; memory_timer = 24

= Historical memory

Franco is still buried in a state monument in the Valley of the Fallen, and tens of thousands of victims of the Civil War and the dictatorship lie in unmarked graves.

- @exhume: Exhume Franco from the Valley of the Fallen
- @graves: Fund the search for the victims' graves
- @easy_discard

@exhume
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {students: 1.5, workers: 1, professionals: 1}); window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'vox', {pensioners: 0.5, self_employed: 0.5}); } Q.progressives_dissent -= 6; Q.rel_up += 4; Q.rel_pp -= 6; Q.franco_exhumed = 1; !}

It takes a year of court battles. When the helicopter lifts the coffin, the left celebrates and Vox finds a new grievance.

@graves
on-arrival: progressives_dissent -= 3; rel_up += 2

Quiet, necessary work. Families find their grandparents.

@pensions
title: Pensions
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_government
view-if: psoe_in_government = 1 and pensions_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; pensions_timer = 12

= Pensions

[? if pensions_promise = 1 : You promised the pensioners that their pensions would rise with prices. ?]The Social Security system runs a deficit. What do you do?

- @index: Index pensions to inflation
- @minimum: Raise the minimum and widows' pensions most
- @easy_discard

@index
subtitle: Deficit +0.3 points
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {pensioners: 3}); } Q.trade_unionists_dissent -= 4; Q.pensions_promise = 0; Q.fiscal_adj += 0.3; !}

Nine million pensioners see it in their next payment.

@minimum
subtitle: Deficit +0.1 points
on-arrival: {! Q.fiscal_adj += 0.1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {pensioners: 1.5, homemakers: 1.5}); } Q.progressives_dissent -= 3; if (Q.pensions_promise) { Q.sanchez_authority -= 2; } !}

Targeted and fair, say the economists. [? if pensions_promise = 1 : Not what you promised, say the pensioners' associations. ?]

@labour
title: The labour reform
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_government
view-if: psoe_in_government = 1 and labour_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; labour_timer = 18

= The labour reform

The PP's 2012 labour reform made dismissal cheaper and weakened collective bargaining. Spain has the highest rate of temporary contracts in the EU.

- @repeal: Repeal it outright
- @social_dialogue: Replace it through an agreement between unions and employers
- @easy_discard

@repeal
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {workers: 3, unemployed: 1.5, self_employed: -2}); } Q.trade_unionists_dissent -= 10; Q.rel_up += 8; Q.rel_cs -= 10; Q.rel_pnv -= 4; !}

The unions celebrate; the CEOE threatens to take it to Brussels.

@social_dialogue
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {workers: 2, unemployed: 1, professionals: 0.5}); } Q.trade_unionists_dissent -= 6; Q.rel_pnv += 3; Q.sanchez_authority += 3; !}

Months of talks produce a deal signed by unions and employers alike: fewer temporary contracts, stronger sectoral bargaining.

@reshuffle
title: Reshuffle the cabinet
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_government
view-if: psoe_in_government = 1 and reshuffle_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; reshuffle_timer = 12

= Reshuffle the cabinet

A minister is damaged by a scandal over a master's degree. The press is asking how long they will last.

- @loyal_cabinet: Bring in your most loyal allies
- @barons_cabinet: Give ministries to people close to the barons
- @experts: Appoint independent experts
- @easy_discard

@loyal_cabinet
on-arrival: sanchismo += 6; sanchez_authority += 3; regional_leaders_dissent += 6

A government of trust. Critics call it a court.

@barons_cabinet
on-arrival: regional_leaders_dissent -= 10; institutionalists_dissent -= 4; sanchismo -= 4

The federations feel represented. Your own people feel overlooked.

@experts
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {professionals: 2}); } Q.modernisers_dissent -= 4; Q.institutionalists_dissent += 3; !}

An astronaut, a judge, an economist from Brussels. The press is impressed for a week.

@tax_reform
title: Tax reform
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_government
view-if: psoe_in_government = 1 and tax_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; tax_timer = 12

= Tax reform

The government's deficit is [+ deficit_text +]% of GDP, with public debt at [+ debt +]%. The Treasury proposes options.

- @corporate: A minimum corporate tax rate for large companies (deficit −0.3)
- @wealth: A tax on large fortunes and a levy on banks (deficit −0.4)
- @green: Green taxes on fuel and flights (deficit −0.2)
- @tax_cut: Cut income tax for low earners (deficit +0.3)
- @easy_discard

@corporate
on-arrival: {! Q.fiscal_adj -= 0.3; Q.rel_up += 4; Q.rel_cs -= 4; Q.rel_pnv -= 2; Q.progressives_dissent -= 3; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.recalculate(Q); } !}

The IBEX-35 companies grumble; the public mostly approves.

@wealth
on-arrival: {! Q.fiscal_adj -= 0.4; Q.rel_up += 6; Q.rel_cs -= 8; Q.rel_pp -= 6; Q.progressives_dissent -= 5; Q.modernisers_dissent += 3; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {self_employed: -1, professionals: -0.5, workers: 0.5}); window.SpainGame.recalculate(Q); } !}

Madrid's regional government promises to cancel it on its territory. The fight over tax becomes a fight between regions.

@green
on-arrival: {! Q.fiscal_adj -= 0.2; Q.rel_up += 2; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {students: 1, self_employed: -1, workers: -0.5}); window.SpainGame.recalculate(Q); } !}

Young urban voters approve. Truck drivers and farmers do not.

@tax_cut
on-arrival: {! Q.fiscal_adj += 0.3; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {workers: 1.5, homemakers: 1, pensioners: 0.5}); window.SpainGame.recalculate(Q); } !}

Popular at home. In Brussels, someone opens a spreadsheet.
